# Language statistics overrides for GitHub Linguist.
#
# The shipped product is the C++ library (include/ + src/ + apps/native) with
# its thin Python command surface. The research scaffolding below is one-off
# experiment tooling that is not part of the library surface. Exclude it from
# GitHub's language breakdown so the reported primary language reflects the
# C++ core.
#
# The archived smartphone phase harnesses (apps/commands/benchmarks/
# gnss_smartphone_phase*.py, tests/test_smartphone_phase*.py, scripts/*_phase*.py
# and their frozen records) were removed from the tree; restore them from the
# tag archive/research-phase-2026-09-28 if needed.

# One-off research analysis and experiment drivers (not shipped commands).
scripts/analysis/**    linguist-vendored
scripts/experiments/** linguist-vendored

# Executable scripts must retain POSIX shebangs in Windows checkouts and
# git archives used as Docker contexts. Frozen JSON/data records are untouched.
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
apps/compat/gnss_pos2kml text eol=lf
